WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.920
In a mandir, Hindus care for a
stone image like an honoured guest.

2
00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:10.620
On a battlefield, a charioteer stops
between two armies and teaches a warrior.

3
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:14.020
Hindus treasure his words
as the Bhagavad Gita.

4
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:18.970
Can God be born as a human, and
also be present in a temple statue?

5
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.440
In this mission, you'll
decode a strip of ten symbols,

6
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.980
from a fish and a tortoise
to one still to come.

7
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:30.140
Then you'll find out why a famous teacher
from another religion appears on some

8
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.760
Hindu lists, and why his
own followers object.

9
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:38.430
Your mission: find out how Hindus
answer both halves of this question.
